INSERT INTO `bantquestion` VALUES (1,1,'What do you currently spend on the Devices. Yearly subscription & Maintenance? This is\nvery important for me to align the right solution from our vast range of products & services\nand provide you with maximum value for your investments\n',1,1,'2026-05-30 05:52:43.181','2026-05-30 11:39:25.812'),(2,1,'Given your volumes, my experience tells me that your cost of operations can roughly be\nxxxx amount per year & savings can be around yyyy. How does that compare to your\nexpectations & the budget you’ve set aside?',2,1,'2026-05-30 05:52:43.242','2026-06-08 09:25:54.803'),(3,1,'Have you identified a budget range for this purchase? Any other solutions you are considering?\n',3,1,'2026-05-30 05:52:43.351','2026-06-08 09:26:22.683'),(4,2,'It is a practice in our organization that our CEO engages with your CEO as a mark of\nrespect and customer relationship. When would you suggest we bring our CEO’s together ?\n\n',4,1,'2026-05-30 05:52:43.486','2026-06-08 09:31:42.837'),(5,2,'Who will use this product and do Departments place orders individually or is there a\ncentralized purchase team – the reason I ask is to prepare my engagements accordingly',2,1,'2026-05-30 05:52:43.652','2026-06-08 09:26:55.259'),(6,2,'The last time you made this purchase, what was the decision making process? How long\ndid it take for the decision to be made ?',3,1,'2026-05-30 05:52:43.759','2026-06-08 09:27:21.654'),(7,3,'If there are 3 Very important areas you are hoping to address through this exercise, what\nwould they be?\n',1,1,'2026-05-30 05:52:43.841','2026-06-08 09:32:14.409'),(8,3,'While I thank you for the opportunity, just to understand your needs better, what would be\nthe scenario if you decided on these 6 months later?',2,1,'2026-05-30 05:52:43.894','2026-06-08 09:32:25.193'),(9,3,'What efforts have you already made to address these pain areas & how is it progressing?\n',3,1,'2026-05-30 05:52:43.998','2026-06-08 09:32:37.648'),(10,4,'Do you have any cut off dates by which you need to complete this deployment?',1,1,'2026-05-30 05:52:44.047','2026-06-08 09:32:58.943'),(11,4,'Typically, what is the process involved – example, after this meeting with you, do I have to\npresent this to a team? Arrange a demo, get our senior leadership to meet etc.?',2,1,'2026-05-30 05:52:44.068','2026-06-08 09:33:11.121'),(12,4,'For our effective support and efficiency in planning resources for your needs, can you\nindicate a time line when you plan to have this closed ?',3,1,'2026-05-30 05:52:44.098','2026-06-08 09:33:25.665');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `bantquestion` ENABLE KEYS */;
